OL,3,GNEWSANew dean will 'continue to address
OL,4,Aconcerns' at scandal-hit cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new dean has been elected at Bangor
OL,7,FCathedral, the Church in Wales has
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FNia Catrin Williams will succeed Right
OL,11,FReverend Manon Ceridwen James in the
OL,12,Frole, who took over as Bishop of Bangor
OL,13,Fin June after criticism was raised by a
OL,14,Fsafeguarding review of the Gwynedd
OL,15,Fcathedral in 2025.
OL,17,FTwo reports revealed a culture where
OL,18,F"sexual boundaries seemed blurred", as
OL,19,Fwell as the use of inappropriate
OL,20,Flanguage and an excessive consumption
OL,21,Fof alcohol.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
