OL,3,GNEWSANew dean will 'continue to address
OL,4,Aconcerns' at scandal-hit cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Church in Wales said Williams will
OL,7,Fcontinue to "address concerns" by
OL,8,F"supporting staff and congregations"
OL,9,Fand "rebuilding trust and confidence".
